OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry and cloudy day
OL,6,Fwith some bright or sunny spells, the
OL,7,Fbest of these in the east. The odd
OL,8,Fblustery shower possible near the
OL,9,FMoray coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThrough the evening and
OL,12,Fovernight it will be mostly cloudy
OL,13,Fwith some clear intervals. Breezy near
OL,14,Fthe coasts. Not quite as cold as
OL,15,Fprevious night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FIt will be a mostly dry and
OL,18,Fcloudy day but with some bright
OL,19,Fintervals breaking through. Outbreaks
OL,20,Fof rain in the evening. Windy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
