OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWindy
OL,6,Fon Sunday with rain, turning wintry
OL,7,Fover the hills, and to lower levels at
OL,8,Ftimes. Heavy showers spreading south
OL,9,FMonday, wintry over hills. Brighter
OL,10,Fspells and showers Tuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
